00:21:45.137 --> 00:21:46.905
SUCH AS DISCIPLINE OR GRIEVANCES

00:21:46.972 --> 00:21:48.240
WITH THEIR UNION REPRESENTATIVE,

00:21:48.306 --> 00:21:51.576
OFTENTIMES TO BE ADDRESSED WITH
CONVERSATIONS

00:21:51.643 --> 00:21:53.412
TO BE MADE CONFIDENTIAL.

