FOR CITY OPERATIONS.

00:27:54.939 --> 00:27:57.208
EMPLOYERS MAY NOT KNOW WHEN THEY
ARE VIOLATING

00:27:57.275 --> 00:27:58.877
THE BILL BY COMMUNICATING WITH
STAFF,

00:27:58.943 --> 00:28:00.378
BECAUSE ONLY THE EMPLOYEE OR

00:28:00.445 --> 00:28:02.881
