ADDITIONALLY, THE TERM EMPLOYEE
REPRESENTATIVE

00:28:09.054 --> 00:28:10.221
AND ADMINISTRATIVE

00:28:10.288 --> 00:28:11.556
DISCIPLINARY INVESTIGATION IS

00:28:11.623 --> 00:28:13.158
NOT DEFINED WITHIN THE BILL,

00:28:13.224 --> 00:28:15.293
