01:01:38.895 --> 01:01:41.464
WHICH WITHIN THE JURISDICTION
OF PERB THAT YEAR.

01:01:41.531 --> 01:01:44.901
SB 857 PROHIBITED PER FROM
AWARDING STRIKE

01:01:44.967 --> 01:01:47.136
PREPARATION EXPENSES AS DAMAGES

01:01:47.203 --> 01:01:51.140
FOR AN UNFAIR FROM AN UNLAWFUL
STRIKE

01:01:51.207 --> 01:01:53.276
DUE TO THE DRAFT A DRAFTING
ERROR.

01:01:53.342 --> 01:01:55.044
THE EMPLOYEE RELATIONS ENTITIES

01:01:55.111 --> 01:01:56.245
IN THE CITY AND COUNTY OF

01:01:56.312 --> 01:01:57.580
LOS ANGELES WERE NOT EXPRESSLY

01:01:57.647 --> 01:01:58.848
