STATE,

01:02:26.175 --> 01:02:28.044
IT'S ALSO ABOUT FAIRNESS FOR
ALL PUBLIC

01:02:28.111 --> 01:02:30.813
AND PUBLIC SECTOR EMPLOYEES IN
CALIFORNIA.

