REQUESTS

01:02:36.252 --> 01:02:37.854
FOR INJUNCTIVE RELIEF BY BOTH
THE CITY

01:02:37.920 --> 01:02:39.188
AND THE COUNTY OF LOS ANGELES,

01:02:39.255 --> 01:02:42.725
JUST AS IT ALREADY HAS FOR ALL
ALREADY

01:02:42.792 --> 01:02:44.427
HAS FOR OTHER PUBLIC AGENCIES.

01:02:44.494 --> 01:02:47.597
IT ALSO CLARIFIES THAT THE LOCAL
EMPLOYEE RELATIONS

01:02:47.663 --> 01:02:48.865
