&GT;&GT; TIFFANY WHITE AND SEIU
CALIFORNIA IN SUPPORT.

01:13:16.792 --> 01:13:17.459
MR.

01:13:17.526 --> 01:13:18.293
CHAIR AND MEMBERS OF THE
COMMITTEE,

01:13:18.360 --> 01:13:19.128
YVONNE FERNANDEZ WITH THE
CALIFORNIA

01:13:19.194 --> 01:13:20.162
LABOR FEDERATION AND STRONG
SUPPORT.

