01:13:23.165 --> 01:13:24.099
CALIFORNIA AND SUPPORT.

01:13:27.402 --> 01:13:28.003
OH, RIGHT.

01:13:28.070 --> 01:13:28.637
THAT LOOKS LIKE.

01:13:28.704 --> 01:13:30.305
THAT CONCLUDES OUR SUPPORT.

01:13:30.372 --> 01:13:32.608
UM, WITNESSES, IS THERE ANY

01:13:32.674 --> 01:13:35.110
