01:13:36.078 --> 01:13:38.013
YOU'LL HAVE A COUPLE OF MINUTES
EACH.

01:13:39.515 --> 01:13:39.982
GREAT.

01:13:40.048 --> 01:13:40.516
THANK YOU.

01:13:40.582 --> 01:13:41.784
GOOD AFTERNOON MEMBERS.

01:13:41.850 --> 01:13:43.652
MY NAME IS LAURA LILLY AND I
AM WITH

01:13:43.719 --> 01:13:45.954
THE PLACER COUNTY OFFICE OF
EDUCATION.

01:13:46.021 --> 01:13:49.324
I'M HERE THIS AFTERNOON IN
OPPOSITION OF AB 2088,

01:13:49.391 --> 01:13:51.560
ON BEHALF OF THE CALIFORNIA
ASSOCIATION

01:13:51.627 --> 01:13:53.095
OF SCHOOL BUSINESS OFFICIALS,

01:13:53.162 --> 01:13:55.531
REPRESENTING 30,000 SCHOOL
BUSINESS

01:13:55.597 --> 01:13:56.965
LEADERS STATEWIDE.

01:13:57.299 --> 01:14:00.736
WHILE WE APPRECIATE THE
INTENTIONS OF AB 2088 TO

01:14:00.803 --> 01:14:03.172
IMPROVE OPPORTUNITIES FOR THE
CLASSIFIED STAFF,

01:14:03.238 --> 01:14:05.274
