MEASURE.

01:14:05.474 --> 01:14:07.242
THIS BILL WOULD IMPEDE THE LEA'S

01:14:07.309 --> 01:14:09.444
ABILITY AT THE LOCAL LEVEL TO

01:14:09.511 --> 01:14:12.080
EXPEDIENTLY HIRE EMPLOYEES BEST

01:14:12.147 --> 01:14:14.349
SUITED FOR OUR STUDENTS NEEDS.

01:14:15.150 --> 01:14:18.253
AB 2088 WOULD LENGTHEN VACANCIES
AND WE ARE

01:14:18.320 --> 01:14:20.522
ALREADY EXPERIENCING STAFFING
SHORTAGES,

01:14:20.589 --> 01:14:23.325
AS WAS MENTIONED, ESPECIALLY IN
THE CLASSROOM

01:14:23.392 --> 01:14:25.327
PARAPROFESSIONAL POSITIONS.

01:14:25.394 --> 01:14:27.596
MANY OF THOSE POSITIONS SERVE
OUR

01:14:27.663 --> 01:14:29.031
STUDENTS WITH DISABILITIES

01:14:29.097 --> 01:14:32.801
WHO HAVE INDIVIDUALIZED
EDUCATION PLANS, OR IEPS,

01:14:32.868 --> 01:14:34.703
AND WE ARE LEGALLY BOUND TO
PROVIDE

01:14:34.770 --> 01:14:36.271
THOSE IMPORTANT SERVICES

01:14:36.338 --> 01:14:39.641
TO OUR STUDENTS IMMEDIATELY AND
CONTINUOUSLY.

01:14:40.776 --> 01:14:42.411
DURING THE PROPOSED TEN DAY WAIT

01:14:42.477 --> 01:14:44.413
PERIOD FOR INTERNAL APPLICANTS.

01:14:44.479 --> 01:14:45.848
FIRST RIGHT OF REFUSAL.

01:14:45.914 --> 01:14:48.884
WE MAY BE LUCKY AND WE MIGHT
FIND A SUBSTITUTE,

01:14:48.951 --> 01:14:50.219
BUT MORE THAN LIKELY WE NEED

01:14:50.285 --> 01:14:52.521
TO HIRE FROM AN OUTSIDE STAFFING
AGENCY

01:14:52.588 --> 01:14:54.456
AT DOUBLE OR TRIPLE THE COST.

01:14:55.591 --> 01:14:58.093
THERE ARE ALSO A WIDE RANGE
OF TASKS

01:14:58.160 --> 01:14:59.361
AND COMPETENCIES REQUIRED

01:14:59.428 --> 01:15:01.663
TO SUPPORT STUDENTS FOR THOSE
WITH

01:15:01.730 --> 01:15:03.165
AND WITHOUT SPECIAL NEEDS.

01:15:03.232 --> 01:15:06.368
WE NEED TO MATCH OUR STAFF SKILL
SETS TO THE STUDENT

01:15:06.435 --> 01:15:09.238
NEEDS IN A HIGHER DATE SHOULD
NOT BE THE FACTOR.

01:15:09.771 --> 01:15:13.575
WE BELIEVE THAT AB 2088 WILL
UNDERMINE OUR LOCAL

01:15:13.642 --> 01:15:16.812
EFFORTS FOR DIVERSITY, EQUITY
AND INCLUSION.

01:15:17.346 --> 01:15:19.948
DISTRICTS ACROSS THE STATE
UNDERSTAND THAT

01:15:20.015 --> 01:15:21.717
OUR STUDENT ATTITUDES ARE
CHANGING,

01:15:21.783 --> 01:15:24.286
AND WE WANT OUR WORKFORCE TO
REPRESENT BOTH

01:15:24.353 --> 01:15:27.089
THE INHERENT AND ACQUIRED
DIVERSITY.

01:15:27.155 --> 01:15:29.558
THIS BILL WOULD MAKE IT
DIFFICULT TO CONSIDER

01:15:29.625 --> 01:15:31.426
DIVERSITY OF OUR DEPARTMENTS,

01:15:31.493 --> 01:15:33.729
OF OUR SCHOOL SITES, OR OUR
DISTRICTS AS

01:15:33.795 --> 01:15:36.531
A WHOLE WHEN MAKING HIRING
DECISIONS.

01:15:36.932 --> 01:15:39.601
IN CLOSING, I'D LIKE THE
COMMITTEE TO CONSIDER

01:15:39.668 --> 01:15:41.970
THE LONG TERM IMPACTS OF THIS
BILL AS WELL.

01:15:42.037 --> 01:15:43.505
SCHOOL DISTRICTS HAVE LIVED
THROUGH

01:15:43.572 --> 01:15:44.840
THE GREAT RESIGNATION,

01:15:44.907 --> 01:15:46.575
AND WE'VE OFTEN HAD TO LOWER

01:15:46.642 --> 01:15:48.176
OUR MINIMUM QUALIFICATIONS

01:15:48.243 --> 01:15:50.145
IN ORDER TO FILL OUR VACANCIES.

01:15:51.280 --> 01:15:53.882
WHAT WILL THE IMPACT BE TO OUR
SCHOOLS OVER TIME?

01:15:53.949 --> 01:15:54.716
&GT;&GT; CAN YOU PLEASE WRAP.

01:15:54.783 --> 01:15:55.817
UP YOUR TIME AS.

01:15:55.884 --> 01:15:56.685
YES.

01:15:56.752 --> 01:15:57.853
WHAT WILL BE THE IMPACT TO OUR
SCHOOLS

01:15:57.920 --> 01:15:59.855
ONCE SENIORITY IS THE MAIN
DRIVER?

01:15:59.922 --> 01:16:01.823
HOW INNOVATIVE WILL CURRENT
EMPLOYEES

01:16:01.890 --> 01:16:03.025
BE KNOWING THAT THEIR

01:16:03.091 --> 01:16:05.394
MEANS TO PROMOTION IS BASED ON
WHEN THEY WERE HIRED,

01:16:05.460 --> 01:16:06.929
NOT THEIR RAPPORT WITH STUDENTS

01:16:06.995 --> 01:16:08.630
OR THEIR EXPERIENCES?

01:16:08.697 --> 01:16:10.332
AND HOW WILL WE ATTRACT NEW
PEOPLE?

01:16:10.399 --> 01:16:12.301
THANK YOU, THANK YOU, THANK YOU.

01:16:14.102 --> 01:16:14.937
NEXT WITNESS.

01:16:15.003 --> 01:16:15.537
YES.

01:16:16.538 --> 01:16:19.408
&GT;&GT; GOOD AFTERNOON, MADAM CHAIR
AND COMMITTEE MEMBERS.

01:16:19.474 --> 01:16:21.677
I'M ERIC ROWAN, EXECUTIVE
DIRECTOR OF HUMAN

01:16:21.743 --> 01:16:24.179
CLASSIFIED HUMAN RESOURCES FOR
THE L.A.

01:16:24.246 --> 01:16:25.914
COUNTY OFFICE OF EDUCATION.

01:16:26.548 --> 01:16:27.916
UM, THANK YOU FOR THE
OPPORTUNITY

01:16:27.983 --> 01:16:28.984
TO SPEAK WITH YOU TODAY.

01:16:29.051 --> 01:16:31.453
WE CAN ALL AGREE THAT CALIFORNIA
STUDENTS DESERVE

01:16:31.520 --> 01:16:33.655
SUPPORT AND SERVICES FROM THE
MOST QUALIFIED,

01:16:33.722 --> 01:16:35.357
PASSIONATE, AND HARD WORKING
EMPLOYEES

01:16:35.424 --> 01:16:37.025
AVAILABLE AT THE TIME OF HIRE.

01:16:37.092 --> 01:16:39.394
UNFORTUNATELY, AB 2088 FAILS A
STANDARD

01:16:39.461 --> 01:16:41.063
AND CREATES UNINTENDED
CONSEQUENCES

01:16:41.129 --> 01:16:43.332
THAT WILL HARM CLASSIFIED HIRING
PROCESSES

01:16:43.398 --> 01:16:45.167
AND IN TURN, OUR STUDENTS.

01:16:45.233 --> 01:16:47.502
THE STATED GOAL OF THIS BILL
IS SIMPLY

01:16:47.803 --> 01:16:50.405
TO ALLOW PART TIME CLASSIFIED

01:16:50.472 --> 01:16:51.573
EMPLOYEES TO INCREASE THEIR
WORKING

01:16:51.640 --> 01:16:53.408
HOURS AND RECEIVE PAID BENEFITS.

01:16:53.475 --> 01:16:55.143
HOWEVER, THE LANGUAGE BEFORE YOU

01:16:55.210 --> 01:16:56.345
APPLIES TO ALL PROMOTIONAL

01:16:56.411 --> 01:16:59.314
OPPORTUNITIES FOR STAFF IN UNION
REPRESENTED

01:16:59.381 --> 01:17:02.384
POSITIONS AND LIMITING THE
DISTRICT'S ABILITY TO

01:17:02.451 --> 01:17:05.153
FILL EVERY SINGLE VACANCY IN A
TIMELY MANNER.

01:17:05.220 --> 01:17:06.922
IT ALSO PREVENTS THE USE OF
EQUITABLE

01:17:06.989 --> 01:17:08.790
AND VALIDATED METHODS FOR HIRING
THE MOST

01:17:08.857 --> 01:17:10.726
QUALIFIED CANDIDATES TO FILL
THESE ESSENTIAL

01:17:10.792 --> 01:17:12.694
ROLES AND SUPPORT OUR STUDENTS.

01:17:12.761 --> 01:17:14.262
YOU OFTEN HEAR CLASSIFIED
PERSONNEL,

01:17:14.329 --> 01:17:16.431
