AND ADMINISTRATIVE

01:17:16.498 --> 01:17:17.766
SUPPORT POSITIONS THAT SERVE AS

01:17:17.833 --> 01:17:19.234
THE BACKBONE OF OUR SCHOOL
COMMUNITIES.

01:17:19.301 --> 01:17:21.169
AND WHILE THAT IS 100% TRUE,

01:17:21.236 --> 01:17:22.270
IT IS IMPORTANT TO NOTE THAT

01:17:22.337 --> 01:17:24.272
THIS BILL WOULD AFFECT A WIDE
VARIETY OF POSITIONS,

01:17:24.339 --> 01:17:27.342
INCLUDING UM, TECHNICAL ROLES

01:17:27.409 --> 01:17:29.211
LIKE NETWORK ENGINEERS,

01:17:29.277 --> 01:17:30.912
ACCOUNTANTS AND BUILDING
ARCHITECTS,

01:17:30.979 --> 01:17:32.681
DIRECT SERVICE ROLES LIKE
SPECIAL EDUCATION

01:17:32.748 --> 01:17:34.383
ASSISTANTS AND OCCUPATIONAL
THERAPISTS,

01:17:34.449 --> 01:17:36.051
AND EVEN SCHOOL POLICE.

01:17:36.485 --> 01:17:38.487
THERE IS NO OTHER INDUSTRY,
PUBLIC OR PRIVATE,

01:17:38.553 --> 01:17:39.955
WHERE THESE ESSENTIAL ROLES
WOULD BE HIRED

01:17:40.022 --> 01:17:41.957
SOLELY BASED ON PROMOTIONAL
STATUS,

01:17:42.024 --> 01:17:45.127
MINIMUM QUALIFICATIONS AND FIRST
RIGHT OF REFUSAL

01:17:46.061 --> 01:17:47.195
IN THE PERSONNEL COMMISSION
OFFICE.

01:17:47.262 --> 01:17:48.830
OUR PRIMARY RESPONSIBILITY IS
TO UPHOLD

01:17:48.897 --> 01:17:50.766
THE PRACTICES PRESCRIBED IN
ED CODE,

01:17:50.832 --> 01:17:53.201
ENSURING HIRING PRACTICES ARE
CONDUCTED IN A FAIR,

01:17:53.268 --> 01:17:55.470
EQUITABLE AND MERIT BASED
MANNER.

01:17:55.537 --> 01:17:56.605
THE REASON I'M HERE TODAY,

01:17:56.671 --> 01:17:58.874
AND THAT SO MANY DISTRICTS AND
ORGANIZATIONS

01:17:58.940 --> 01:18:00.308
LIKE THE CALIFORNIA PERSONNEL

01:18:00.375 --> 01:18:01.877
COMMISSION ASSOCIATION,

01:18:01.943 --> 01:18:04.846
IS BECAUSE THIS PROPOSED
LEGISLATION WOULD

01:18:04.913 --> 01:18:07.282
SKIP OVER OUR PROCESSES
COMPLETELY.

01:18:07.549 --> 01:18:09.851
UM, FOR EXAMPLE, THIS BILL WOULD
REQUIRE

01:18:09.918 --> 01:18:12.120
DISTRICTS TO HIRE AND PROMOTE
BASED

01:18:12.187 --> 01:18:14.189
ON MINIMUM QUALIFICATIONS FOR
THE POSITION

01:18:14.256 --> 01:18:15.957
BUT OTHER EDUCATION CODE.

01:18:16.024 --> 01:18:16.925
SO PLEASE WRAP UP.

01:18:16.992 --> 01:18:17.259
OKAY.

01:18:17.325 --> 01:18:17.526
THANK YOU.

01:18:17.959 --> 01:18:18.660
SURE.

01:18:18.727 --> 01:18:21.229
SO OTHER EDUCATION CODE DICTATES
THAT

01:18:21.296 --> 01:18:22.831
THOSE MINIMUM QUALIFICATIONS
SHOULD

01:18:22.898 --> 01:18:25.300
BE AS LOW AS POSSIBLE TO ENSURE
A DIVERSE

01:18:25.367 --> 01:18:28.036
GROUP OF QUALIFIED APPLICANTS.

01:18:28.103 --> 01:18:31.173
AND UNFORTUNATELY, THIS, UM,

01:18:31.373 --> 01:18:33.775
THIS BILL WOULD NOT ALLOW US TO

01:18:33.842 --> 01:18:35.077
CONSIDER THOSE APPLICANTS.

01:18:35.143 --> 01:18:36.311
THANK YOU VERY MUCH.

01:18:36.845 --> 01:18:37.679
THANK YOU.

01:18:37.746 --> 01:18:38.947
SO ANYONE SPEAKING IN OPPOSITION
TO THE BILL,

01:18:39.014 --> 01:18:39.915
PLEASE STEP FORWARD.

01:18:39.981 --> 01:18:41.683
