01:18:42.350 --> 01:18:44.553
GOOD AFTERNOON, MADAM CHAIR
DOROTHY JOHNSON,

01:18:44.619 --> 01:18:45.654
ON BEHALF OF ACSA,

01:18:45.720 --> 01:18:47.956
THE ASSOCIATION OF CALIFORNIA
SCHOOL ADMINISTRATORS,

01:18:48.023 --> 01:18:49.324
IN RESPECTFUL OPPOSITION,

01:18:49.391 --> 01:18:50.559
