01:19:03.605 --> 01:19:05.974
ALSO IN OPPOSITION TO CITRUS
COLLEGE,

01:19:06.041 --> 01:19:08.610
MOUNT SAN ANTONIO COLLEGE AND
NORTH ORANGE

01:19:08.677 --> 01:19:09.978
COUNTY COMMUNITY COLLEGE
DISTRICT AS WELL.

01:19:10.045 --> 01:19:10.579
THANK YOU.

01:19:13.782 --> 01:19:15.250
THANK YOU, ANDREA BALL ON BEHALF

01:19:15.317 --> 01:19:16.818
