01:20:48.643 --> 01:20:51.213
BUT WAS IN THE LARGEST HIGH
SCHOOL

01:20:51.279 --> 01:20:52.514
DISTRICT IN NORTHERN CALIFORNIA.

01:20:52.581 --> 01:20:54.983
AND OF COURSE, I'VE STILL BEEN
CONNECTED

01:20:55.050 --> 01:20:56.084
THROUGH ALL MY LOCAL GOVERNMENT

01:20:56.151 --> 01:20:59.421
