WITH

01:20:59.487 --> 01:21:01.356
THAT DISTRICT AND MANY OTHERS.

01:21:01.423 --> 01:21:05.093
BUT HAVING BEEN THERE AS A
SCHOOL

01:21:05.160 --> 01:21:07.095
BOARD MEMBER FOR EIGHT YEARS.

01:21:08.430 --> 01:21:09.364
YOU KNOW, I'M.

01:21:10.365 --> 01:21:12.734
FALLING ONCE AGAIN ON THE SIDE
OF

01:21:12.801 --> 01:21:15.070
